        {
          "title": "Open the Inbox",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>As a leader, tap <strong>Inbox</strong>. <strong>Reported by your unit</strong> counts enemy reports by who in your unit made them.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/dd43501e9e51eeb4.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open a count",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a sub-unit, such as <strong>2R</strong>, to list its reports with time, direction and distance.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/02f2d18298f5e3dd.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Show them on the map",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Show all on map</strong>. The map zooms out to fit all of them.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
